# Git must not rewrite line endings in this repository.
#
# The renders under tests/golden/ are compared byte for byte against what the
# binary prints. A checkout with core.autocrlf=true — the default on Windows,
# and what GitHub's windows-latest runner does — turns every one of them into
# CRLF and every golden test into a failure that reproduces on no other
# platform. The fixtures they are generated from have the same problem, and
# `mdr` deliberately handles CRLF *input*, so the fixtures must be able to
# carry the exact bytes the test intends rather than whatever the checkout
# decided.
#
# LF everywhere, on every platform, no exceptions.
* -text
